# Local-first, then Vercel

- Build and review every feature on `http://localhost:3000`.
- Do not push to `origin/main` (or otherwise trigger a Vercel deploy) until Huy says the local changes look good and agrees to proceed.
- Local git commits are fine when Huy asks to save work. Pushing to GitHub `main` is the production deploy.
- Production is [thehobbiest.vercel.app](https://thehobbiest.vercel.app/). V1 stays an experiment branch.
- After Huy approves, push `main` and tell him the live site will update after the Vercel deploy.
